{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t重陽節假期前的周末，昨日有超過135萬人次經各口岸出入境；本地居民出境人次超過67萬，內地訪客入境人次超過13萬。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n最多人經羅湖管制站出境，逾17萬人次；其次是落馬洲支線管制站，有逾13萬人次。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n皇崗口岸出入境人次約13萬人次，當中本地居民出境人次佔逾6萬。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T02:58:42.078946+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T02:35:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T03:38:14.516726+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T02:57:35.441967+00:00","content_hash":"36e85ce4d08b546fe2da26b0bc191f51bdeaafc0f099bc1b07a48b7e27955130","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}